#: scripts/world/tv_broadcast.gd:235
msgid "A LOS VECINOS DE LA CALLE OLMOS:\nESTA NOCHE HAY VISITA.\nNO LA BUSQUE CON LOS OJOS.\nA LA VISITA NO LE GUSTAN LAS FOTOS.\nSI ALGUIEN CANTA, NO LE DÉ LA ESPALDA.\nSI LE DICEN «TE ESTOY VIENDO», SIGA ANDANDO.\nSI PREGUNTA DÓNDE ESTÁ, NO CONTESTE.\nBUENAS NOCHES."
msgstr "TO THE RESIDENTS OF OLMOS STREET:\nTONIGHT THERE IS A VISITOR.\nDO NOT LOOK FOR IT WITH YOUR EYES.\nTHE VISITOR DOES NOT LIKE PHOTOGRAPHS.\nIF SOMEONE SINGS, DO NOT TURN YOUR BACK.\nIF YOU ARE TOLD \"I CAN SEE YOU\", KEEP WALKING.\nIF IT ASKS WHERE YOU ARE, DO NOT ANSWER.\nGOOD NIGHT."

